            <ArticleTitle>[The effect of intra-aortic balloon pumping in case of left main coronary artery stenosis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>418-23</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In order to improve perfusion of coronary artery in case of coronary artery stenosis, effect of intra-aortic balloon pumping (IABP) on coronary blood flow (CBF) was investigated. To this end hemodynamic parameters of heart functions with and without stenosis were analysed under IABP. Hemodynamic effect of IABP was obviously influenced by the coronary artery stenosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
